# DigitalFadi

> DigitalFadi is the freelance Google Ads practice of {{ site.authorName }}, a Google Ads
> freelancer and Google Premier Partner. He manages Search, Shopping, Performance Max,
> YouTube, Display, Demand Gen and remarketing personally, built on verified conversion
> tracking and managed against cost per lead or sale. Clients work with him directly.

## Facts

- Operates on one advertising platform only: Google Ads. No SEO, social advertising,
  branding or website builds.
- Five years running Google Ads accounts. More than 100 businesses served across the
  US, UK and Australia. 25 accounts live at present, across twelve sectors.
- 2026 Google Premier Partner, a tier held by roughly the top 3% of participating
  companies per country. Top Rated Plus on Upwork with a 100% job success score.
- Sectors: skincare, electronics, fall-alert wearables, private label manufacturing,
  SaaS, media firms, law firms, HVAC, landscaping, moving companies, logistics,
  apartment rentals.
- Pricing, published: $100 one-time account analysis, $499 per month management,
  or 10% of managed ad spend for larger accounts. USD. Ad spend is paid by the client
  directly to Google and is never invoiced or marked up.
- Contact: {{ site.email }}, or book a 15-minute call at {{ booking.url }}. Messages monitored 24/7, reply within one working day.

## Services

- [Google Ads audit]({{ site.url }}/google-ads-audit/): a free audit that lists the issues in an
  account, or the $100 written account analysis that adds the solution for each issue,
  delivered within 3 days.
- [Google Ads for e-commerce]({{ site.url }}/google-ads-for-ecommerce/): Merchant Center
  and product feed work first, then Shopping and Performance Max structured by margin.
- [Google Ads for local services]({{ site.url }}/google-ads-for-local-services/): Local
  Services Ads and geo-targeted Search, measured on booked jobs rather than calls.

